  "title": "DirecTV removes Scripps local stations from its channel lineup",
  "summary": "Local television stations in about 40 markets owned by The E.W. Scripps Company (NASDAQ: SSP) are no longer accessible to DirecTV subscribers as Scripps works to reach a new contract agreement with DirecTV that would restore critical local news, weather and sports programming for consumers across the country.",
